          "Close team roster only when the destination field in the task queue shows the approved change and the task record supports it. Compare the task record, the approval, and the final value in the task queue before marking the team roster complete. A reopened case should show what changed, who noticed it, and which earlier decision is now in question. If the destination is a downstream team, keep the team roster open until that team acknowledges receipt."
